// WHY THIS IS A CURATION QUEUE AND NOT A MERGE ENGINE
// ---------------------------------------------------
// Sam asked for "a Common CR Reference just as we have pretty well developed
// CER, CSR, and the beginnings of a CCR", and ruled that C-ID is only ONE
// factor — "similar to the CCR, we take into account matching factors like
// title, course name and number, course description, subject, etc."
